/** \page memmap_page Memory allocation on MCU

Memory on the microcontroller is allocated as follows in the linker files.

Note: the bootloader flash reserved space is larger than it needs to be for release in order to accommodate the larger debug build of the bootloader and to ensure that the position of the FDS pages is consistent between the two builds.

| Section                   | Access   | Origin      | Length   | End    |
|---------------------------|----------|-------------|----------|----------|
| RAM (BL)                  | rwx      | 0x20005978  | 0x3A688  | 0x2003FFFF  |
| RAM (APP)                 | rwx      | 0x20004BE0  | 0x3B420  | 0x2003FFFF  |
| UICR MBR PARAMS (BL)      | r        | 0x10001018  | 0x04     | 0x1000101C  |
| UICR (BL)                 | r        | 0x10001014  | 0x04     | 0x10001018  |
| SETTINGS (BL)             | r        | 0xFF000     | 0x1000   | 0xFFFFF  |
| MBR PARAMS (BL)           | r        | 0xFE000     | 0x1000   | 0xFEFFF  |
| APP DATA (APP)            | rx       | 0xFD000     | 0x1000   | 0xFDFFF  |
| FLASH (BL)                | rx       | 0xF7000     | 0x6000   | 0xFCFFF  |
| FDS (APP)                 | rwx      | 0xED000     | 0x3000   | 0xEFFFF  |
| FLASH (APP)               | rx       | 0x27000     | 0xC6000  | 0xECFFF  |
    
*/


